  "notes": "Workday CXS for tenant intel, site External. The machine request is POST https://intel.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/intel/External/jobs with a JSON body {appliedFacets, searchText, sortBy, limit, offset}: no filters returns 860 jobs, appliedFacets locations=[India, Bangalore] plus searchText=software returns 47, and sortBy=postedOn returns the newest postings first. The API's facet list is Job Category (jobFamilyGroup), Job Type (workerSubType), Time Type (timeType) and Locations (locations under locationMainGroup). The extra 'Job Type' facet (appliedFacets[workerSubType]: Regular / Student-Intern / Contract Employee) exists but has no matching schema key, so it is not exposed here.",
